et."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"servicesList":["Brand identity","Packaging","Art direction","Website design"],"textColor":"white","websiteURL":"https://zoefull.com/"},"workModules":[{"_key":"986bcb83907a","_type":"workSingleImage","media":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"Zoeful product family","asset":{"_ref":"image-417df0cd22017d9ef6a175f3d5c15b6ac3654098-3200x1800-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"}},{"_key":"3adc4e07254d","_type":"workTextBlock","content":[{"_key":"dd22d96406fb","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b09b65a8126c0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"We collaborated with Zoefull to help them distill their essence into an accessible yet authentically Greek brand. Given that the name comes from the Greek word for “life”, we took inspiration from all things life-affirming. Architecture, food, colours, flavours—even the Zoefull team’s personal memories—all came together to inform the joyful end result."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"From Greece with love"},{"_key":"e18553745712","_type":"workDoubleImage","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/933908712-1440p.mp4"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/933917100-1440p.mp4"}},{"_key":"db061ffc0d37","_type":"workTextBlock","content":[{"_key":"94128aa272c9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"7bb35bab6bd40","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"That authentic narrative throughline gave us a strong launching point into developing a complete visual identity system, including branding, packaging design, art direction and e-commerce website."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"A comprehensive brand system"},{"_key":"61fdf07b6905","_type":"workSingleImage","capWidth":true,"media":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","thumbnail":{"alt":"Thumbnail for Vimeo video 1088207085","url":"/ext/vimeo-img/2020375089-bc9b5a3de2f4164fcf5a5d810592a566c653fa2e134d91262a97aa04be72772a-d.jpg"},"video":"/ext/video/1088207085-1440p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null,"vimeoId":"1088207085"}},{"_key":"e2208f05a613","_type":"workSingleImage","capWidth":true,"media":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/933929414-1440p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null}},{"_key":"64279411a934","_type":"workSingleImage","capWidth":true,"media":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/933921657-1440p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null}}]},"orderRank":"0|10001g:i","ourProcess":{"hideProcessButton":true},"slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"ora-organic"},"thumbnailContent":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","thumbnail":{"alt":"Thumbnail for Vimeo video 1083693933","url":"/ext/vimeo-img/2014949893-e763da4bd62c6cecbbdea2087528e5e6de68401eab730e83303358947f20569a-d.jpg"},"video":"/ext/video/1083700320-720p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null,"vimeoId":"1083700320"},"thumbnailCover":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-dc632dd370980a60435b72c96f172d704dcdd33c-5376x3584-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image","video":"/ext/video/1083693933-720p.mp4","vimeoId":"1083693933"},"thumbnailExcerpt":"A long-term design partnership with one of the industry's best.","title":"","workHeroSection":{"backgroundColor":{"label":"Custom","value":"#ebeae9"},"heroMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-dc632dd370980a60435b72c96f172d704dcdd33c-5376x3584-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"sectionContent":[{"_key":"5bb8f02ea72a","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"df4f01cf7dbd0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" is one of the pioneering plant-based supplement companies. They're bringing transparency, quality and a little bit of joy to the industry. As design partner of record, we work together on brand identity, packaging, web design, and ongoing campaigns."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"servicesList":["Web Design","Brand Identity","Print Design","Art Direction","Photography","Campaigns"]},"workModules":[{"_key":"e4924b8d6579","_type":"workT